luminous (\$43.1{\textless}{\textbackslash}log L\_\{{\textbackslash}rm bol\}/(\{{\textbackslash}rm erg s{\textasciicircum}\{-1\}\}){\textless}44.4\$) Seyfert
galaxies (NGC 788, Mrk 607, NGC 3227, NGC 3516, NGC 5506 and NGC 5899)
in the Local Universe (\$0.0039},
